# Private working data -- this repo is public. The master spreadsheet (and
# every backup or export of it) holds employer contact names, phone numbers
# and emails that were removed from the published map on 2026-10-19. They stay
# on disk for the scraper pipeline but must never be committed here. The only
# employer data that belongs in this repo is employers_geocoded.geojson, which
# build_geojson.py writes from an allowlist of public columns.
employers_master.xlsx
employers_master.backup_*.xlsx
~$*.xlsx
backups/
companies.json
__pycache__/
